  "result": "Perfect! I've added payment tracking functionality:\n\n**src/payments.js** \u2014 Added:\n- **balanceDue(invoice)** \u2014 Returns amount still owed: `total - sum(payments)`, minimum 0\n- **recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })** \u2014 Records a payment:\n  - amount must be positive integer (in cents)\n  - date must be valid 'YYYY-MM-DD'\n  - Creates payments array if missing\n  - Updates status to 'paid' (balance = 0) or 'partially_paid' (balance > 0)\n  - Returns ok(newInvoice) with payment added\n  - Errors: NOT_ISSUED, AMOUNT_INVALID, DATE_INVALID, OVERPAYMENT\n\n**src/errors.js** \u2014 Added:\n- NOT_ISSUED: Can only record payments on issued or partially_paid invoices\n- OVERPAYMENT: Payment exceeds amount owed\n\n**Key design:**\n- Payments must be whole cents (positive integers)\n- Status transitions: issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid\n- Can't pay a draft or already-paid invoice\n- Multiple payments accumulate\n- Never mutates input invoice\n\nAdded 24 tests covering balance calculations, payment recording, status transitions, validation, and mutation safety. All 137 tests pass.",
